    {
      "name": "dsh-netgate-win",
      "title": {
        "zh": "网闸 · Windows 版",
        "en": "NetGate for Windows"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "输入框上方一键切换：断网时移除 web 搜索与网页抓取，并拒绝 bash / pwsh / terminal 里的联网命令；关闭后旁边出现严格模式按钮，可连 shell 一起停用。本地读写、编译与测试照常。",
        "en": "One switch above the composer: while offline it removes web search and fetch and refuses networked shell commands; a strict button appears while off and removes the shell too. Local edits, builds and tests keep working."
      },
